title: "orbis: Interactive and High-Resolution Layered Graphics with Built-in World Maps"
abstract: >-
  A layered grammar of graphics that compiles plots to a resolution-independent scene description and renders it as interactive SVG or at any resolution through R's graphics devices, with built-in world maps and map projections.
